flowchart LR
  SDB[Source DB<br/>Postgres/MySQL/SQL Server] --> CDC[CDC Capture<br/>Reads WAL/binlog]
  CDC --> KRAW[Kafka Raw CDC Topics<br/>Append-only change log]

  KRAW --> VAL[Validate<br/>Schema • required fields]
  VAL -->|Fail| DLQ[DLQ Topic]
  VAL -->|Pass| XFORM[Transform optional<br/>Unwrap • Map • Dedupe • Handle deletes]

  XFORM --> SINK[Sink Writer<br/>Upserts/Inserts/Deletes]
  SINK --> TDB[Target Postgres<br/>Tables / Read Model]

  RPL[Replay/Backfill<br/>Reprocess from raw topics] --> KRAW
  OBS[Observe<br/>Connector health • lag • errors • deadlocks] -.-> CDC
  OBS -.-> SINK